        <mxCell id="phase2" value="B  批准与编排：先审方案，再生成任务；二审通过后才能发布" style="html=1;fontFamily=PingFang SC;fontColor=#172B45;whiteSpace=wrap;text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=22;fontColor=#172B45;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
